Let me implement:

```python
NESTED_PIN_CONTAINERS = {"evidence", "pins", "target_pins"}
def hash_pin_values(rec):
    for k,v in rec.items():
        if k in PIN_KEYS:
            yield f"{k}", v
        elif k in NESTED_PIN_CONTAINERS and isinstance(v, dict):
            for k2, v2 in v.items():
                if k2 in PIN_KEYS:
                    yield f"{k}.{k2}", v2
    # no deeper
```
